					<div class="mx-auto flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white shadow-sm">
						<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-brand-blue" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-on-surface">Quality Guaranteed</h3>
					<p class="text-brand-text">We stand by our products. If you aren't satisfied, we'll make it right.</p>
